{"name": "Lichgate: Tower Survivor", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lichgate: Tower Survivor</strong> is easy to learn- collect an arsenal of weapons and upgrades to defend from the continual onslaught of monsters. Surviving all nine gates of hell, however, will require strategy, cleverness, and...\u00a0<i>FLAMETHROWERS?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.poster.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"896\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.webm?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.mp4?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/0a1459157c77238f5020231f65e13698.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft your own tower of destruction.</strong> Mix and match from over 100 weapons and upgrades to make a different build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"132\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4638e3c67988436ef89c4fdbc2363a60.poster.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"580\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4638e3c67988436ef89c4fdbc2363a60.webm?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your shop to gain access to legendary weapons to obliterate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"440\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/18c9822fde576998fe5ec5688a69c062.poster.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/18c9822fde576998fe5ec5688a69c062.webm?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4feca8abd631d127600ac4a90997d552.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weigh the consequences of devilish pacts that will unlock your true potential, but will also affect how enemies get stronger.</strong>\u00a0Each type of enemy is strong or weak against different types of damage, so choose pacts that fit your build accordingly. Perhaps it's worth it to be greedy and take the perfect relic despite the consequences. You'll have to determine if economy, powerful relics, or higher quality items are what you need to succeed.\u00a0Choose from the options available, or up the ante and bargain for a better deal at the risk of what it may cost you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.poster.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"896\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.webm?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.mp4?t=1777055526\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/c2b6204ec7d672fbb42abbaf8d48b95c.avif?t=1777055526\" width=\"256\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive 50 rounds with different builds to gain access to new relics to shape future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat each gate to unlock new difficulties that introduce new twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete on leaderboards with your friends to see who can survive the longest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect achievements by surviving with unique constraints that challenge your strategies.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Burn through the underworld legion in this rogue-lite Tower Survivor. Craft the ultimate tower of destruction and survive as long as you can against endless hordes of enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/b8288ccd503764b6ca3c2d00efa77c66013e5202/header.jpg?t=1777055526", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Tower Defense", "Auto Battler", "Roguelite", "Combat", "Score Attack"], "developers": "Sun Lion Games", "publishers": "Sun Lion Games", "release_date": "Apr 24, 2026", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3458500", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/LVhyQWfnTZE", "first_seen": 1768608000.0, "review_rank": 1374}